``dials.stills_process``: avoid work whose result is discarded during indexing and refinement — the per-model debug dumps, the residual summary tables and the per-panel RMSD table are now built only when the log level will emit them, the target Bravais type is cached on ``SymmetryHandler``, and the per-reflection D matrices are gathered by panel index instead of by a masked assignment per panel. Most noticeable on many-panel detectors.
